an><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; text-indent: -92.5pt; margin-top: 5pt; margin-left: 92.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">공고내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">교내 장기 방치로 확인된 자전거 대하여 개별 안내문을 부착한 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2021. 6. 25.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">까지 개별 안내문이 부착되어 있는 경우 일괄 폐기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">예정임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; margin-top: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">개별 안내문 부착 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 2021. 6. 7.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) ~ 6. 8.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; margin-top: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">문 의 처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: